stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle: Connection Created
    Idle --> Connecting: start() called
    Connecting --> Connected: Tunnel Established
    Connecting --> Error: Connection Failed
    Error --> Idle: User Stop
    Error --> Connecting: Auto-Retry
    Connected --> Disconnecting: stop() called
    Disconnecting --> Idle: Tunnel Torn Down
    Connected --> Error: Health Check Failed
    Connected --> Reconnecting: Connection Lost
    Reconnecting --> Connecting: Retry Delay
    Reconnecting --> Error: Max Retries

    note right of Connecting
        WireGuard: wg-quick interface setup
        OpenVPN: TLS handshake + TUN create
    end note

    note right of Connected
        Health check thread polls
        interface every N seconds
    end note
